== Notes ==

* This spell stacks with the [[blackguard]]'s [[bull's strength (feat)|bull's strength]] feat.
* If the maximum strength increase is not achieved, the spell can be cast again for a chance at a higher die roll (up to +5 regularly or +7 [[empower spell|empowered]]). The recast will not lower the ability score.
*Due to a .2da bug, ''bull's strength'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of ''ray of enfeeblement''.

